    "identifier": "ODIN_SWRACER_SOUND_MODE_INFO_0",
    "text": "Star Wars Racer Arcade has an optional sound board: Main, the main board alone; Both, the two mixed, the optional one at Optional Board Level; 4.0, as the desktop's Quad: four channels, the main board in the front speakers, the optional one in the rear at Optional Board Level (RetroArch folds them for stereo; a RetroArch without multi-channel sound gets Both); Optional Only, the optional board alone.",
